    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build To Satisfy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create brilliant musical patterns and chaotic points machines in this unique physics-based idle-progression game. Unlock and deploy dozens of unique bumpers, cannons, flippers, explosives and more that have you scoring exponentially more points with every addition to your simulation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/bd9129f3c0b08b7104ae2bcdb175df0a.poster.avif?t=1741924045\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/bd9129f3c0b08b7104ae2bcdb175df0a.webm?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/bd9129f3c0b08b7104ae2bcdb175df0a.mp4?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simulate To Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the pinball machine of your dreams with balls flooding everywhere or a precision Rube-Goldberg machine that collects every coin in a stage. As long as the balls keep moving the points (<i>and music</i>) will flow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/e0db18b69a0b1fa62954f993cd5d1e0d.poster.avif?t=1741924045\" width=704 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/e0db18b69a0b1fa62954f993cd5d1e0d.webm?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/e0db18b69a0b1fa62954f993cd5d1e0d.mp4?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I didn't know you were a chill game like that.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through four stages with unique mechanics and music while unlocking over 250 achievements. Once you've seen the stages, <u><i>Ascend</i></u><i>\u00a0</i>your progression by spending achievement points to make your next run faster, and allowing you to complete even greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/b019ce3e0f00ba70ef296f694e33084b.poster.avif?t=1741924045\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/b019ce3e0f00ba70ef296f694e33084b.webm?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/b019ce3e0f00ba70ef296f694e33084b.mp4?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build To Satisfy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create brilliant musical patterns and chaotic points machines in this unique physics-based idle-progression game. Unlock and deploy dozens of unique bumpers, cannons, flippers, explosives and more that have you scoring exponentially more points with every addition to your simulation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/bd9129f3c0b08b7104ae2bcdb175df0a.poster.avif?t=1741924045\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/bd9129f3c0b08b7104ae2bcdb175df0a.webm?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/bd9129f3c0b08b7104ae2bcdb175df0a.mp4?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simulate To Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the pinball machine of your dreams with balls flooding everywhere or a precision Rube-Goldberg machine that collects every coin in a stage. As long as the balls keep moving the points (<i>and music</i>) will flow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/e0db18b69a0b1fa62954f993cd5d1e0d.poster.avif?t=1741924045\" width=704 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/e0db18b69a0b1fa62954f993cd5d1e0d.webm?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/e0db18b69a0b1fa62954f993cd5d1e0d.mp4?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I didn't know you were a chill game like that.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through four stages with unique mechanics and music while unlocking over 250 achievements. Once you've seen the stages, <u><i>Ascend</i></u><i>\u00a0</i>your progression by spending achievement points to make your next run faster, and allowing you to complete even greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/b019ce3e0f00ba70ef296f694e33084b.poster.avif?t=1741924045\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/b019ce3e0f00ba70ef296f694e33084b.webm?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/b019ce3e0f00ba70ef296f694e33084b.mp4?t=1741924045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
